    "body": "Yes I'm seeing that chromium doesn't assert this: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/navigation_api/navigation_api.cc;l=585;drc=eca8e9ffa43954933a88393cb15959eff13efde0\n\n@NateChapin do you have any context on this?\nOtherwise I think this assert should be removed.",
